<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115221" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρ-ιστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separable,</i> physically or logically, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ ἢ τόπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					413b14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγέθει</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				432a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ νοήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					193b34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸν λόγον χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1025b28
				</span></i>
			; of the Platonic ideas, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1086b9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1096b33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κτῆμα</span>
			<i>alienable</i> property, of slaves, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1254a17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>existing separately, abstract,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐθὲν . . χωριστόν ἐστι παρὰ τὴν
					οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					185a31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1028a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1029a28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ποσόν</span>
			<i>abstract</i> quantity, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.3.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. δημιουργία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.144b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.217d
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, al., Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.5.18
			</span></i>.</div>
